You have the right to know what you're being exposed to in any work environment.
在任何工作环境中，你都有权知道自己接触的是什么。

10
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:46,220
Heavy Data Sheets will be your go-to resource for understanding what known hazards you'll
安全技术说明书将是你了解化学品暴露方面会面临哪些已知危害的

11
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:49,300
be facing in terms of chemical exposure.
首选资料。

12
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:53,420
This can range from simple cleaning materials to hazardous waste.
范围可以从简单的清洁用品一直到危险废物。

13
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:57,500
You'll want to be thinking about the health, physical and environmental hazards of anything
你要考虑你所使用的任何东西的健康危害、物理危害和

14
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,940
you're working with.
环境危害。

15
00:00:58,940 --> 00:00:59,940
2.
第二。

16
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:04,460
Despite being at the bottom of the inverted hierarchy of controls pyramid, that PPE has
尽管 PPE 位于倒金字塔形控制层级的最底部，但它

