像你的第二语言一样。

23
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:31,460
The safety data sheets are part of this, but the nuts and bolts include properly labeling
安全技术说明书是其中的一部分，但核心内容包括正确地给容器贴标签，

24
00:01:31,460 --> 00:01:36,540
and, when needed, relabeling, containers to identify chemicals and hazards.
必要时重新贴标签，以标明化学品和危害。

25
00:01:36,540 --> 00:01:41,940
Developing and maintaining a written hazard communication plan, reading placards, and overall,
制定并维护书面的危害沟通计划，阅读标牌，总的来说，

