Said every lab rat ever, eventually.
每个实验室小白鼠迟早都会这么说。

50
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:45,340
And of course, general safety hazards, like cryogenics, open flames, situations requiring
当然还有一般安全危害，比如低温、明火、维护时需要执行

