lockout-tagout procedures for maintenance, you know, the list just goes on.
上锁挂牌程序的情况，你知道，这个清单还可以一直列下去。

52
00:02:49,420 --> 00:02:53,580
Depending on your work, you may even be dealing with radioactive materials.
